      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "“可爱”的表舅",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "今天去到几分钟就吃饭了，我吃了两碗饭。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "那你们去到可能有点晚了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "吃完饭，我们还在餐馆里跑来跑去。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "其他人你都认识不？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "有些认识，有些不认识。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你今天看到表舅了吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "看到了。表舅……有点可爱？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "是表舅有点可爱吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_008_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "008",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:009",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "表舅儿子有点可爱。我还摸了他...",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-12-the-cute-uncle_dialogue_009_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "009",
